{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 3980,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# DataManagement ingestion: observed path and current-code alternatives\n**Symptom:** On 19 November the research session found no accepted papers to keep, although processing had produced staged readings and graph artifacts.\n**Root cause:** Historical OP1: no accountable final acceptance handoff; later backlog visibility fixes must not rewrite this run.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `ingestion.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-scopeNote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Historical default follows the partial cohort. Other branches are current-code alternatives; red arrows mean alternatives, not failure. Unexercised paths are not claimed as events.",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Tier 0 agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-a1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** directs E:\\DataManagement ingestion into Resource-Library with pre-read exclusions; later partial acceptance remains an explicit decision",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Owner"
      }
    },
    {
